{"id":"n58314-1-3","stage":4,"title":"배회 · 徘徊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58314-1-3-1","ko":"오래 기다리느라 심심했지?","zh":"等了这么久，应该有点无聊吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오래","meaning":"好久，很久","explanation":"오래：好久，很久。","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}},{"text":"기다리느라","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；느라：说明因忙于前一动作而出现后续情况，常接不利结果。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다리느라","audio":"/audio/8d4c62999614f8bc6b8c.mp3"}},{"text":"심심했지?","meaning":"无聊","explanation":"심심하다：无聊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"심심하다","audio":"/audio/3fc3b6b7d32bb06de335.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16445","senseId":"1","lemma":"심심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심심했지","audio":"/audio/73c89b215fc99f0a2247.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f64811b687303a9","term":"오래","zh":"好久，很久","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3","entryId":"57308","definition":"长时间。","pronunciation":["오래"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"3fc3b6b7d32bb06d","term":"심심하다","zh":"无聊","audio":"/audio/3fc3b6b7d32bb06de335.mp3","entryId":"16445","definition":"没有可做的事，没有意思，很乏味。","pronunciation":["심심하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1505eed62f64a3d0e119.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58314-1-3-2","ko":"아니야. 근처 여기저기 배회를 하며 구경 중이었어.","zh":"没有啊。我一直在附近四处转转，看看风景呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아니야：不是，不对。","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29726","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}},{"text":"근처","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}},{"text":"여기저기","meaning":"到处，这里那里","explanation":"여기저기：到处，这里那里。","readings":[{"term":"여기저기","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70994","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기저기","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3"}},{"text":"배회를","meaning":"徘徊","explanation":"배회：徘徊；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배회","audio":"/audio/9fd14b691a3884a7a1c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58314","senseId":"1","lemma":"배회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배회를","audio":"/audio/9cf05e4dbf72d3dc4e22.mp3"}},{"text":"하며","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하며","audio":"/audio/3b1c9412801289ec45ad.mp3"}},{"text":"구경","meaning":"赏，观看，游览","explanation":"구경：赏，观看，游览。","readings":[{"term":"구경","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64484","senseId":"3","lemma":"구경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구경","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3"}},{"text":"중이었어.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"3","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중이었어","audio":"/audio/07f6c6b648a409939dbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b8a273e5d75f1fd1","term":"아니야","zh":"不是，不对","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3","entryId":"29726","definition":"用于回答提问，表示强调或坚决否定。","pronunciation":["아니야"]},{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"9e2ef8f34a6bbf71","term":"여기저기","zh":"到处，这里那里","audio":"/audio/9e2ef8f34a6bbf710011.mp3","entryId":"70994","definition":"没有明确定下的多个场所或位置。","pronunciation":["여기저기"]},{"id":"9fd14b691a3884a7","term":"배회","zh":"徘徊","audio":"/audio/9fd14b691a3884a7a1c3.mp3","entryId":"58314","definition":"没有特别目的地以某处为中心到处转悠。","pronunciation":["배회","배훼"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f7bcc82cf5b9252f","term":"구경","zh":"赏，观看，游览","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3","entryId":"64484","definition":"用眼睛看或亲自体验。","pronunciation":["구ː경"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"处在某状态的期间。","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"处在某状态的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]}],"audio":"/audio/50e07f69b679b9c7ac20.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58314","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["等了这么久，应该有点无聊吧？","没有啊。我一直在附近四处转转，看看风景呢。","地上怎么会有这么多水啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["等了这么久，应该有点无聊吧？","没有啊。我一直在附近四处转转，看看风景呢。","地上怎么会有这么多水啊？"],"answer":1}]}
